      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "The system determines what constitutes “expensive” based on the nature of the network interface and other factors. iOS 13 considers most cellular networks and personal hotspots expensive.",
      "contextAfter": "In this case, the error provided when the task fails has a [`networkUnavailableReason`](urlerror/networkunavailablereason-swift.property.md) property whose value is [`NSURLErrorNetworkUnavailableReasonExpensive`](nsurlerrornetworkunavailablereason/nsurlerrornetworkunavailablereasonexpensive.md).",
