      "normalizedSource": "In this case, the error provided when the task fails has a [`networkUnavailableReason`](urlerror/networkunavailablereason-swift.property.md) property whose value is [`NSURLErrorNetworkUnavailableReasonExpensive`](nsurlerrornetworkunavailablereason/nsurlerrornetworkunavailablereasonexpensive.md).",
